<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "Characters in a Space can spar with each other. Combat is friendly by design: a knockout never has any lasting effect, and anyone sitting down is out of the fight entirely."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_control}>{dgettext("help_space", "Attacking")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "Stand next to another character and press Space — or tap the sword button on the on-screen pad — to swing your weapon. The swing connects with the character on the tile you are facing, or with whoever is standing beside you. Every class swings its own weapon."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_community}>{dgettext("help_space", "Taking hits and health")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "A landed hit staggers the target and deals damage. Hurt characters show a slim health bar under their name; it disappears once they are back at full health."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lightbulb}>{dgettext("help_space", "Knockouts")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "At zero HP a character is knocked down and stays on the ground for a few seconds — they cannot move, attack or be attacked while down. They then get back up on their own with full health, ready for the next round."
  )}
</p>
